The WLED driver's documentation header uses the WLED logo artwork, cropped but otherwise
unmodified, from the WLED project. Its icons and DriverCentral product card use Akemi,
the WLED mascot, from the WLED documentation, recolored in a rainbow like the WLED app's
icon.

